<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Delta Insurance '96 profit up 63 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Delta Insurance '96 profit up 63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996			  1995</p>
<p>    Total premium Income  540	    vs	   330</p>
<p>    Investment  Income     50	    vs	    10</p>
<p>    Claims		    100	    vs	    50</p>
<p>    Life Fund		 460	    vs	    240</p>
<p>    Dividend		  26 taka on 100- taka share vs 12 taka</p>
<p>(Note: Bangladesh Delta Life Insurance Limited, held its annual general meeting on Tuesday. The company annual report said its income surged manily because of effective marketing, strict screening and efficient service.)</p>
</text>
